[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5478767513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123003#issuecomment-5478767513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123003","id":5478767513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRo9bmQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T13:04:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T13:04:02Z","body":"Note that all tab names are also stored in the TabContainer itself.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"538\" height=\"416\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca03bf87-80ca-4b13-9bd7-20f90e4ab301\" />\r\n\r\nIt'd be faster to collect the names beforehand, so the properties would need to be iterated once.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5478767513/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5482840096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123003#issuecomment-5482840096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123003","id":5482840096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRs2AIA","user":{"login":"Leroymilo","id":88249282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MjQ5Mjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88249282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo","html_url":"https://github.com/Leroymilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leroymilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T18:41:14Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T18:51:48Z","body":"> Note that all tab names are also stored in the TabContainer itself.\r\n> It'd be faster to collect the names beforehand, so the properties would need to be iterated once.\r\n\r\nAfter some gdscript testing, I noticed that the `tab_<n>/title` property of the `TabContainer` (as well as the `metadata/_tab_name` property of the `TabContainer`'s child) are only set if a custom tab name was set for tab `n`, so it might be harder than expected to maintain the \"use node name if no custom tab title is set\" feature without scanning the tab node's properties for the _tab_name.\r\n\r\nI think it might still be possible by checking for which tab nodes have indices that don't appear in the `tab_<n>/title` properties of the `TabContainer`, and adding their names manually. I'll try implementing this to see if it's possible, but it might be above my level and I'm not sure that it would be faster/more efficient than the first solution proposed.\r\n\r\nEdit: tracking indices might not actually be possible because it would require manually counting direct children of the `TabContainer` (node index isn't saved in most cases according to doc and testing), and I think this roundabout method breaks in case of instantiated and inherited scenes...","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5482840096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]